sequenceDiagram
  actor U as Discord user
  participant B as QABot (bot.py)
  participant P as permissions / tiers
  participant Q as qa.handle_question
  participant R as retrieve
  participant G as Gemini (llm.py)
  participant D as bot.db
  participant S as answerstyle
  U->>B: /ask question (or @mention)
  B->>P: invocation_allowed(channel), member_tier(roles)
  P-->>B: tier non-member | member | officer
  B->>Q: handle_question(question, asker, scope)
  Q->>R: retrieve(question, scope, llm)
  R->>S: expand_terms() local synonyms
  R->>G: (1) expand_query
  alt Gemini fails / 429
    R-->>R: local synonyms only
  end
  R->>D: FTS search docs (allowed tier bases) + messages (visible channels, minus blocklist/opt-outs)
  D-->>R: hits
  Q->>R: rerank(hits)
  R->>G: (2) rerank / pick entries
  Q->>G: (3) answer(prompt, context)
  Q->>Q: is_grounded() local self-check (no model call)
  alt grounded
    Q->>S: present_answer() + citation_line()
  else gap / above-tier
    Q-->>Q: unknown reply or approval request (db.create_approval)
  end
  Q->>D: asklog.record(ask_log)
  Q-->>B: Result
  B-->>U: reply (mentions neutralized)
